{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XnXjnGvm9q27anhDaPMWQe","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 structfuse-context 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (5 个)\\n\\n- **mvp_sva_gpt2_k3**: RUNNING — \\n- **mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi**: DEPLOYED (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-13\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| mvp_sva_gpt2_k3 | SVA (localized-circuit task) 上 CSS=1.0 faithfulness > single-method，验证 IOI 发现在第三任务泛化（D025 条件④） | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3** (negative): Arithmetic task 上 CSS off-diagonal ≥5%，跨任务验证 IOI 发现非 task-specific（D021 CSS-only gate） ← 基于 mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\n  [mvp_gate_checklist_d025](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3/report/mvp_gate_checklist_d025.md) | [acdc_topk_sweep_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3/report/acdc_topk_sweep_results.md) | [mean_ablation_arithmetic_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3/report/mean_ablation_results.json) | [topk_faithfulness_final](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3/report/topk_faithfulness_final.md)\\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3** (success): CIRCUS-core edges中≥10%落入off-diagonal cell (method-specific but not CSS-confirmed)\\n  [D020_acdc_edge_selection](/api/workspace-files/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3/report/D020_acdc_edge_selection.md)\\n- **mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v2** (failed): CIRCUS-core edges中≥10%落入off-diagonal cell (method-specific but not CSS-confirmed)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 1 / 负向 1 / 失败 1 / 共 3\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\ncqa1-2