_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1601, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"d29b68b2-9f8d-4ccd-8744-edabbd5cad4f","timestamp":"2026-05-13T06:28:07.401Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014Kc3EqsY5K9uqCYptgZdQm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SNT3o7wP9SC86h1ZWfDqS2","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"structfuse-context","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2083,"cache_read_input_tokens":17800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2083,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":71,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"473115be-ad65-4228-95f9-1294d5951bdb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SNT3o7wP9SC86h1ZWfDqS2","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — structfuse-context\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 越界教训 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n第三次 GPU 越界事件：PID 897752 占用 cuda:0（属于 rl-active-probe-fl），导致对方数据丢失。根因：旧进程或直接运行库模块时未设 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES，torch 默认使用 cuda:0。\\\\n\\\\n**硬规则**：\\\\n- 项目只有 cuda:5@cqa1-21977，所有 .py 文件（含库模块）必须在 import torch 前用 `os.environ.setdefault(\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\")` 防护\\\\n- 入口脚本用 `os.environ[\\\\\\\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\\\\"] = \\\\\\\"5\\\\\\\"`（强制覆盖），库模块用 `setdefault`（不覆盖入口已设的值）\\\\n- Worker 提交实验必须用 submit_training_job（自动管理 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES），禁止 nohup\\\\n\\\\n## ACDC isinf 退化——核心方法论问题 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\nACDC binarization 用 `isinf` 只选出极少边（IOI 14, Arithmetic 17），但 ACDC 实际有 0.03-0.09 四级中间分数。isinf 导致 CSS=1.0 与 ACDC 完全重合，跨方法共识退化。top-k binarization（k=50-75）解决此问题：Arithmetic CSS 3/3 从 17→44-54。\\\\n\\\\n**但 top-k 未翻转条件④**：CSS=1.0 mean CPR=0.919 < EAP-IG=0.985。\\\\n\\\\n## D021: CSS-only 叙事 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n放弃 CIRCUS 作为独立 claim。转 CSS-only 叙事。\\\\n\\\\n## 竞争定位：CSS vs CIRCUS (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n- **CIRCUS (Parekh, 2026)** 最大竞争对手。CSS 差异化 = method diversity > threshold diversity\\\\n- **Mondorf et al.** direct competitor：仅 gradient 族、score averaging（非 binary consensus）\\\\n- 关键支撑：Miller et al. (COLM 2024) faithfulness 对消融敏感；Méloux et al. EAP/EAP-IG 高方差\\\\n\\\\n## D026: MVP Gate 最终结论 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n**Arithmetic 条件④ FAIL（CSS=1.0 < EAP-IG），IOI PASS。**\\\\n\\\\n关键教训：\\\\n1. **Zero ablation 是 artifact 源**——所有小电路 zero CPR 为负，mean ablation 翻正到 0.9+\\\\n2. **节点级 ablation 的局限**——CSS=1.0 CPR 在 k=50→75 不变（节点集相同，边数变化无法区分）\\\\n3. **EAP-IG×EP 在 arithmetic 上 Jaccard=0.695**——两方法高度一致，CSS 缺少第三方视角的信息增益\\\\n4. **IOI 上 CSS 边效率极高**——14 edges CPR≈50 edges 单方法，每条边贡献远超单方法\\\\n5. **IOI CPR 不一致是误报**——mean_ablation_results.json 中标注为 IOI 的数据实际是 Arithmetic\\\\n\\\\n**等待 Director 决策：edge-efficiency claim / 原 claim + 更多任务 / pivot。**\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1632, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"fc279212-c6a7-437e-b572-d00806ba310e","timestamp":"2026-05-13T06:28:10.951Z"}
