aithfulness（证明 consensus 的功能价值）。两条都满足 → PASS_MAIN；只满足一条 → 评估是否 task-specific；都不满足\\\\n    → 重新评估方向。同时要求 Arithmetic Phase D 使用 mean ablation 作为 zero ablation 的对比，排除 ablation\\\\n    方式的影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: faithfulness ranking supports CSS > single-method\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: pending - must verify both off-diagonal + faithfulness ordering\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'CRITICAL: stable_core faithfulness 三重 FAIL，暂停 MVP pass 判定。根因是 D013 CIRCUS\\\\n    退化未修复——stable_core CPR=-0.187 远差于 CSS≥0.67 (CPR=+0.063)。必须先修复 CIRCUS (2D non-nested\\\\n    grid) 再重评。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度验证发现：(1) stable_core IOI recall 仅 0.17 (2/12)，因为 CIRCUS-core\\\\n    系统性选中 Negative Name Mover 通路而非核心 IOI 正向信号边；(2) 这是 D013 CIRCUS 1D percentile →\\\\n    top-k EAP-IG 退化的直接后果；(3) CSS≥0.67 单独就达到 12/12 IOI recall + 正向 CPR，说明 cross-tabulation\\\\n    的\\\\\\\"附加价值\\\\\\\"目前为负；(4) D018 条件性 pass (off-diagonal 13.3%) 在 faithfulness 硬伤未修复前无效。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: stable_core CPR=-0.187, IOI recall=0.17; CSS≥0.67 CPR=+0.063, recall=1.00\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 CIRCUS 作为独立 claim，转 CSS-only 叙事。CIRCUS 三次修复均失败，降级为 negative ablation\\\\n  rationale: CIRCUS 经历三轮修复全部失败：(1) D013 发现 1D percentile 嵌套退化为 top-k；(2) D020 stable_core\\\\n    faithfulness 三重 FAIL；(3) random-subset fix 后 stable_core CPR=-0.023, IOI recall=0/12，比旧版更差。根本问题是\\\\n    faithfulness-based stability scoring 在当前 circuit 粒度下无法产出有意义的 stable core。ARR DDL\\\\n    剩 12 天，不能再投入时间调试。CSS off-diagonal 13.3% 已过 gate，CSS-only 叙事足够支撑论文。CIRCUS 失败作为\\\\n    negative ablation 保留（\\\\\\\"structural consensus > faithfulness scoring\\\\\\\"），反而强化 CSS 的\\\\n    claim。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CSS off-diagonal 13.3% pass, but CIRCUS stable_core triple fail\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: ongoing\\\\n    result: Arithmetic validation running, independent of CIRCUS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 紧急处理第三次 GPU 越界事件：杀 PID 897752 + 根因排查 + 强制 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5\\\\n  rationale: Manager 报告进程 PID 897752 (17GB, 100% util) 越界占用 cuda:0（属于 rl-active-probe-fl\\\\n    项目），已导致对方代码和数据丢失。这是 cqa1-21977 上第三次越界事件，Manager 警告再犯将回收 GPU。根因待 Agent 排查（CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\n    未正确设置或被覆盖）。要求所有后续实验脚本开头强制 export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: suspected_source\\\\n    result: 疑似越界进程来源，待确认\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 澄清 D021 与 D002 灰区关系：Arithmetic 实验 gate 统一为 CSS off-diagonal ≥5%，D002 的\\\\n    5-10% 灰区规则不再适用\\\\n  rationale: D002 原定义基于 CIRCUS-core edges：≥10% PASS_MAIN，5-10% 灰区走 Findings track。D021\\\\n    已从 CIRCUS 转向 CSS-only，指标体系变化，原灰区阈值不再有意义。Arithmetic 实验 gate 统一为 CSS off-diagonal\\\\n    ≥5% = PASS（确认跨任务泛化性），<5% = FAIL。D002 的 5-10% 灰区规则被 D021 显式 deprecate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: gate_experiment\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: D021 覆盖 D002 灰区定义：arithmetic CSS off-diagonal ≥5% 即为 PASS，不再区分灰区\\\\n  rationale: D002 原定 5-10% 为灰区（走 Findings track），≥10% 为 PASS_MAIN。D021 pivot 为 CSS-only\\\\n    后将 arithmetic gate 改为 ≥5%。Reviewer 指出两者语义冲突。决定：D021 显式覆盖 D002 的灰区规则。理由：CSS-only\\\\n    pivot 后 off-diagonal 的意义更明确（纯 consensus 信号），5% 阈值已足够表明 cross-method structural\\\\n    agreement 非 task-specific。D002 的 5-10% 灰区基于 CIRCUS+CSS 混合框架下的不确定性，该前提已不存在。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 03:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 更新 Arithmetic gate 为 CSS-only 四条件标准（替代 D024 的单一 5% 阈值）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现：(1) run_arithmetic.py 代码仍跑 CIRCUS cross-tabulation + D002\\\\n    旧阈值，D024 未落地到代码；(2) CIRCUS 已知 broken（D013 nesting + D017 scope mismatch），基于 CIRCUS\\\\n    的 off-diagonal % 无意义。采纳 Reviewer 建议的 CSS-only 四条件 gate：① Pairwise Jaccard 任意方法对\\\\n    < 0.70 ② CSS ≥2/3 edge count ≥ 10 ③ CSS = 1.0 edge count ≥ 3 ④ CSS faithfulness\\\\n    > single-method（D019）。四条全满足 = PASS。实验不中断（ACDC 75%+），结果出来后忽略代码 gate_verdict，人工按新标准判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 03:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: Arithmetic D025 gate FAIL（条件④），暂不判 MVP 结果，先做 ACDC 阈值 ablation + mean ablation\\\\n    诊断\\\\n  rationale: Arithmetic CSS=1.0 CPR=-0.197 < EAP-IG CPR=-0.142，条件④失败。但 Reviewer 同时发现两个方法论问题：(1)\\\\n    ACDC isinf 仅保留 17 边，与 EAP-IG/EP 各 100 边形成 6:1 不对称，CSS=1.0 退化为纯 ACDC 输出；(2) 所有小电路\\\\n    CPR 均为负，zero ablation 可能对 Greaterthan 过于苛刻。这两个问题在 IOI 上同样存在但被正结果掩盖。在排除 binarization\\\\n    artifact 和 ablation method artifact 之前，不应判定 CSS 方法论失败。诊断方案：(a) ACDC top-k 阈值 sweep（k=50/100/150，CPU\\\\n    分析，不需新 GPU 实验）；(b) mean ablation 替代 zero ablation 重算 Phase D。两者均可在已有 raw scores\\\\n    上快速完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: D025 gate FAIL (condition ④)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 最终判定：CSS faithfulness 优势 task-dependent（IOI PASS / Arithmetic FAIL），不\\\\n    kill，reframe claim scope\\\\n  rationale: Arithmetic D025 条件④在 2 ablation × 4 k = 8 个配置下全部 FAIL，排除了 isinf 退化和 zero\\\\n    ablation artifact。IOI 在 zero ablation 下一致 PASS（k=isinf/50/100 均通过）。CSS 不是普遍优于单方法，而是在\\\\n    localized-circuit 任务（IOI 有明确的 Name Mover 等组件）上有效，在 distributed-computation 任务（Greaterthan）上无效。D003\\\\n    kill criteria 未触发（两任务 off-diagonal 均 >2%）。方向决策：(1) 不 kill 项目 (2) Reframe：从\\\\\\\"CSS\\\\n    always better\\\\\\\"转为\\\\\\\"CSS identifies faithful consensus when circuits are localized;\\\\n    reveals task structure when they're not\\\\\\\" (3) 补 1-2 个任务建立 localized vs distributed\\\\n    模式 (4) 这个发现本身比 universal claim 更有学术价值——审稿人更 appreciate nuanced finding。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: FAIL (condition ④ across all 8 configs)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: PASS (consistent across k and ablation)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D021\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 16747, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"4694b1b0-69c0-4999-8519-7e5b945fb23d","timestamp":"2026-05-13T06:28:11.626Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014Kc3EqsY5K9uqCYptgZdQm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015yAEwP5opCuFUvBmhknNfm","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"structfuse-context","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2083,"cache_read_input_tokens":17800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2083,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":71,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"3a4c1a56-4fed-4289-a092-c434d0ee7495"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015yAEwP5opCuFUvBmhknNfm","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/structfuse-context/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — structfuse-context\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-13 | 更新原因: MVP 结果出齐，基于 D027 reframe\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\nEMNLP 2026 Main (ARR deadline 2026-05-25)\\\\n\\\\n## Core Insight\\\\nCross-method binary consensus (CSS) identifies faithful and edge-efficient circuit subsets **when discovery methods genuinely disagree** (low pairwise Jaccard). When methods are highly correlated (high Jaccard), CSS degenerates and provides no additional value over any single method. Inter-method correlation is a predictive signal for consensus utility.\\\\n\\\\n## Narrative Arc\\\\n1. Circuit discovery methods (EAP-IG, Edge Pruning, ACDC) find different circuits for the same task — but which edges are \\\\\\\"real\\\\\\\"?\\\\n2. We propose CSS: binary consensus scoring across K≥3 methods from different algorithmic families\\\\n3. CSS=1.0 (full consensus) circuits are dramatically smaller yet comparably or more faithful — but only when methods provide independent evidence\\\\n4. When methods are correlated (same algorithmic family, or task structure forces agreement), CSS degenerates to the most selective method\\\\n5. This reveals a fundamental property: consensus value ∝ method diversity, measurable via pairwise Jaccard\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 1: CSS identifies edge-efficient consensus circuits (PRIMARY)\\\\n- **Evidence needed**: CSS=1.0 CPR ≥ best single-method CPR on tasks with low inter-method Jaccard\\\\n- **Current status**: IOI PASS (CSS=1.0 14 edges, CPR=0.109 > all 50-edge single methods)\\\\n- **Strength**: Strong on IOI; needs 2+ more localized-circuit tasks\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 2: CSS utility is predicted by inter-method correlation (PRIMARY)\\\\n- **Evidence needed**: Positive correlation between method diversity (1 - max pairwise Jaccard) and CSS faithfulness advantage\\\\n- **Current status**: IOI Jaccard=0.31 → CSS works; Arithmetic Jaccard=0.695 → CSS fails. Two data points.\\\\n- **Strength**: Mechanistically motivated, needs 3+ tasks to establish pattern\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 3: ACDC isinf binarization causes CSS degeneration (METHODOLOGICAL)\\\\n- **Evidence needed**: Show CSS=1.0 ≡ ACDC under isinf; top-k breaks degeneration\\\\n- **Current status**: Fully demonstrated on both IOI and Arithmetic\\\\n- **Strength**: Strong, fully supported\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 4: CSS as diagnostic taxonomy (SECONDARY)\\\\n- **Evidence needed**: CSS distribution (1/3, 2/3, 3/3 proportions) reveals task structure\\\\n- **Current status**: IOI has dispersed CSS distribution (low 3/3 ratio); Arithmetic has concentrated distribution (high 3/3 ratio when k normalized)\\\\n- **Strength**: Needs more tasks and mechanistic analysis\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n\\\\n### R1: \\\\\\\"Only 2 tasks, generalization unclear\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Add SVA (localized), DocQA or similar (distributed) to establish pattern\\\\n- **Phase 2 models with IFR** naturally increase method diversity → should help\\\\n\\\\n### R2: \\\\\\\"CSS=1.0 edge efficiency could be just circuit size effect\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Size-normalized CPR comparison; show CSS=1.0 achieves same CPR as 3-5x larger single-method circuits\\\\n\\\\n### R3: \\\\\\\"EAP-IG and EP are gradient-adjacent, K=3 effectively K≈2\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Phase 2 adds IFR (similarity-based, different family); Jaccard analysis shows exactly when this matters\\\\n\\\\n### R4: \\\\\\\"Why not use score averaging instead of binary consensus?\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Binary consensus is threshold-free (no score calibration needed across methods); compare with Mondorf et al. score averaging\\\\n\\\\n### R5: \\\\\\\"ACDC binarization sensitivity undermines robustness\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Top-k normalization as standard preprocessing; show results stable across k=50-150\\\\n\\\\n## Competitors\\\\n- **CIRCUS** (Parekh 2026): Threshold diversity within single method; we tried it, it failed (D021 negative ablation)\\\\n- **Mondorf et al.** (2510.06811): Cross-method score averaging (gradient family only); we use binary consensus across diverse families\\\\n- **PIE** (2604.16889): Iterative pruning ensemble; single paradigm\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3865, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016CBqndFAp9sdeP5oG5H6Zh","session_id":"da6c2831-13c3-4ab7-a8ff-27a4cd9a02b2","uuid":"aa06d1ec-842d-4d2b-8e1e-58e29e03d65e","timestamp":"2026-05-13T06:28:11.984Z"}
